# Copy to `.env.local` (untracked). Vite inlines VITE_* values into the renderer bundle at build time.
#
#   cp .env.local.example .env.local
#
# The COP map's basemap tiles come from CARTO, which now requires a free key on every request. Without
# one, every tile is replaced by an "API KEY REQUIRED" watermark. Request a key (free, arrives by email,
# works at once) at https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/ -- the free commercial tier is 1,000,000 tile
# requests a month, the non-commercial tier 5,000,000. The key is counted per account and is not secret
# in the way a write token is, but do not share it with unrelated projects. `npm run release*` refuses
# to build without a key that CARTO actually accepts.
VITE_CARTO_KEY=
